main.content:
[[Nevermore III: The Raven Staff]] is a [[Legendary Weapons]] [[collection]] [[achievement]] to gain the [[precursor weapon]], [[The Raven Staff]], for the [[Legendary weapon|legendary]] [[staff]], [[Nevermore]]. This collection is the third step to obtain the precursor.

== Achievement ==
{{achievement box}}

